msgid "GraalVM/Mandrel upgrade"
msgstr ""

msgid "Today, we released Quarkus 2.13.4.Final with a new round of bugfixes and documentation improvements."
msgstr ""

msgid "It is a recommended upgrade for anyone already using 2.13."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you are not already using 2.13, please refer to https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-2.13[our migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "We don't usually upgrade GraalVM/Mandrel in a micro release but GraalVM/Mandrel 22.3 is a LTS release and we decided to move to it early, rather than wait for Quarkus 2.15."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We don't think it will cause problems for applications but you might have to adjust your extensions if you make use of GraalVM substitutions.\n"
"Make sure to have a look at https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-2.13[our migration guide] if it is the case."
msgstr ""

msgid "Also, GraalVM/Mandrel 22.2 is now the minimal version to use to build native executables."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr "完全な変更履歴"

msgid "You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.13.4.Final[the full changelog of 2.13.4.Final on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr "参加のお誘い"

msgid "We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... Let's build something great together!"
msgstr "私達は皆様からのフィードバックに重きを置いています。バグ報告、改善要望を是非お願いします。一緒に素晴らしいものを作り上げていきましょう!"

msgid "If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our welcoming community:"
msgstr "Quarkusユーザーの場合でも、単に興味を持っているだけの場合でも、恥ずかしがらずにコミュニティに参加して下さい!:"

msgid "provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub] でフィードバック"

msgid "craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr "コードを作成し、 https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[プルリクエスト] を送信"

msgid "discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr "https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] や https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[メーリングリスト] でディスカッションに参加"

msgid "ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow] で質問"
